(205, 50, 98, NULL, 'Omar Khaled', 'Engineer', 'F5FFF9', 5, 'This grocery shop offers the best variety in town. I can always find everything I need, whether it\'s everyday essentials or special ingredients. The store is well-organized and clean. Great shopping experience!', '2026-05-25 10:14:54', '2026-05-25 10:14:54'),
