(207, 50, 98, NULL, 'Ahmed Al-Farsi', 'Business Consultant', 'FFF5F5', 5, 'I’ve been a regular shopper here for months, and I am never disappointed. The quality of the fresh produce and meats is always top-notch, and the prices are very reasonable. The staff is incredibly helpful and friendly.', '2026-05-25 10:14:54', '2026-05-25 10:14:54'),
