(709, 110, 137, NULL, 'إميلي كلارك', 'رائدة أعمال', 'FAF5FF', 5, 'الملابس رائعة ومصممة لتدوم. السبب الوحيد في إعطائي أربع نجوم بدلاً من خمس هو أنني أتمنى رؤية المزيد من خيارات الألوان في بعض المجموعات!', '2026-08-18 10:45:39', '2026-08-18 10:45:39'),
(710, 110, 225, NULL, 'Sarah Johnson', 'Fashion Blogger', 'FFF5F5', 5, 'I absolutely love the unique styles and quality of fabrics. Every outfit I’ve purchased has been a perfect fit, and the designs are always on trend!', '2026-08-18 10:45:39', '2026-08-18 10:45:39'),
(711, 110, 225, NULL, 'Michael Adams', 'Creative Director', 'F5FFF9', 5, 'I was blown away by the variety of styles available. The customer service is top-notch, and the pieces always make me feel confident and stylish!', '2026-08-18 10:45:39', '2026-08-18 10:45:39'),
(712, 110, 225, NULL, 'Emily Clark', 'Entrepreneur', 'FAF5FF', 5, 'The clothes are fabulous and made to last. The only reason I’m giving four stars instead of five is that I’d love to see more color options in some collections!', '2026-08-18 10:45:39', '2026-08-18 10:45:39'),
