(97, 46, 10, 3, '', '2025-03-09 05:22:37', '2025-03-09 05:22:37'),
(98, 56, 18, 3, '', '2025-03-09 05:28:00', '2025-03-09 05:28:00'),
(99, 56, 17, 4, '', '2025-03-09 05:28:09', '2025-03-09 05:28:09'),
(100, 56, 10, 5, '', '2025-03-09 05:28:16', '2025-03-09 05:28:16'),
(101, 46, 15, 5, '', '2025-03-11 04:22:02', '2025-03-11 04:22:02'),
(102, 61, 177, 4, 'I’ve been using the Goldfish Floating Pellets (500g) for a few weeks now, and overall, it’s been a great choice for my aquarium. The pellets are the perfect size for small to medium goldfish, and since they float, it’s easy to monitor how much the fish are eating—less waste, clearer water.', '2025-09-10 06:51:14', '2025-09-10 06:51:14'),
(103, 61, 170, 5, 'A small wet cat food can tailored for daily servings or as a topper. The manageable 185 g size is ideal for portion control, especially for multi-cat households or multi-meal routines.', '2025-09-10 06:51:45', '2025-09-10 06:51:45'),
(104, 61, 176, 3, 'A ubiquitous choice for feeding a variety of tropical freshwater fish—this 250 g tropical flake mix typically offers a well-rounded diet packed with proteins, essential vitamins, and minerals. Many similar products (e.g., from Serene Aquarium) boast formulations with around 42% crude protein, 8% fat, and low moisture (around 6%)—common traits for high-quality flake foods', '2025-09-10 06:54:41', '2025-09-10 06:54:41'),
(105, 61, 174, 5, 'NutriMix Parrot Blend (1 kg) appears to be a parrot feed mix—likely containing a variety of seeds, grains, maybe nuts or dried fruits, potentially with vitamin-enriched pellets. Parrot blends generally aim to provide energy, flavor variety, and some nutritional enhancement.', '2025-09-10 06:55:05', '2025-09-10 06:55:05'),
(106, 62, 193, 5, 'The Almond Infused Body Oil 200ml is a nourishing, lightweight, and non-greasy formula that deeply hydrates the skin, improves elasticity, and leaves a natural glow. Enriched with vitamin E and antioxidants, it’s suitable for all skin types and perfect for daily use, though it may feel slightly heavy in very humid weather if overapplied.', '2025-09-12 23:44:49', '2025-09-12 23:44:49'),
(107, 62, 194, 4, 'The Exfoliating Sugar Body Scrub gently removes dead skin cells, leaving the skin smooth, refreshed, and glowing. Infused with nourishing ingredients, it hydrates while exfoliating, making it ideal for regular use to achieve soft and radiant skin.', '2025-09-12 23:45:18', '2025-09-12 23:45:18'),
(108, 62, 192, 3, 'Women’s Perfume – Floral Elegance offers a refreshing blend of floral notes with a long-lasting fragrance. It’s elegant, feminine, and perfect for both daily wear and special occasions.', '2025-09-12 23:45:43', '2025-09-12 23:45:43'),
(109, 62, 191, 2, 'Mint Fresh Lip Balm 10g delivers instant hydration with a cooling minty feel, keeping lips soft, smooth, and refreshed. Compact and perfect for daily use.', '2025-09-13 00:04:10', '2025-09-13 00:04:10'),
(110, 62, 187, 1, 'Cocoa Butter Body Lotion 400ml provides deep nourishment and long-lasting hydration, leaving skin soft, smooth, and radiant with a subtle cocoa fragrance.', '2025-09-13 00:04:30', '2025-09-13 00:04:30'),
(111, 62, 184, 5, 'Radiance Renewal Face Serum brightens dull skin, boosts hydration, and enhances natural glow with lightweight, fast-absorbing care suitable for daily use.', '2025-09-13 00:04:47', '2025-09-13 00:04:47'),
(112, 63, 195, 5, '“This necklace is absolutely stunning! The diamond accent sparkles beautifully, and the gold chain feels very high quality. I’ve received so many compliments whenever I wear it.”', '2025-09-14 05:31:13', '2025-09-14 05:31:13'),
(113, 63, 204, 4, '“These earrings are absolutely gorgeous! The sapphire accent adds the perfect touch of color, and the gold hoops feel very sturdy. I wear them almost every day.”', '2025-09-14 05:31:37', '2025-09-14 05:31:37'),
(114, 63, 202, 3, '“This bracelet is so pretty and feminine! The little heart pendants add a romantic touch, and the gold finish looks very high quality. I wear it every day, and it still shines beautifully.”', '2025-09-14 05:31:59', '2025-09-14 05:31:59');
