(208, 101, 207, 'Browse by Exclusive Category', 'Featured Products', NULL, 'Our Super Flash Sale Items', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'What Say Our Customer About Us', 'This keeps it friendly and inviting while focusing on the positive experiences of your customers. If you want something a bit more specific or personalized, feel free to let me know!', NULL, 'Skincare That Loves You Back Safe and Effective Solutions', 'Our products are crafted with clean, high-quality ingredients to give your radiant, healthy skin every day. Whether you\'re looking for deep hydration,anti aging solutions, or a natural glow, we’ve got you covered.', NULL, '8ca3c8010dd3873506db0578ab5982082dee2d69.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Showcase Our Similar Items', NULL, NULL, 'Don’t miss the chance to get our exclusive products, available at special discounted prices for a limited time only—once they’re gone, they’re gone!', '2026-07-23 09:48:09', '2026-07-23 09:48:09', 'View Products', '/skinflow/shop');
