(18, 10, 15, 'grocery store, online grocery shopping, buy groceries online, grocery delivery, fresh food delivery, grocery store near me, best grocery deals, fresh fruits, vegetables, organic groceries, local grocery shop, grocery discounts, online shopping for groceries, grocery shopping site, fast grocery delivery', 'Welcome to Grocery – your go-to online grocery store for fresh produce, dairy, snacks, beverages, organic products, and more. Shop quality groceries and get fast delivery at unbeatable prices. Explore amazing deals and start shopping today!', 'buy groceries online, online grocery shopping, grocery delivery service, fresh fruits, vegetables, organic groceries, pantry essentials, snacks, beverages, household products, fresh meat, dairy products, grocery store, online grocery deals', 'Browse and shop fresh groceries online at Grocery. From organic produce to pantry staples and household essentials, we offer a wide selection of high-quality groceries with convenient delivery options. Start shopping now and get the best deals!', 'frequently asked questions, grocery shopping FAQs, online grocery help, grocery delivery questions, order tracking, payment methods, shipping policy, returns and refunds, customer support, grocery store help, online grocery questions', 'Find answers to your questions on our FAQs page. From order tracking to delivery and returns, get the help you need with your grocery shopping experience at Grocery. Have more questions? Contact our customer support team!', 'contact us, customer support, grocery help, online grocery inquiries, grocery delivery contact, grocery shopping questions, contact grocery store, customer service, reach out to us, online shopping support', 'Need assistance? Get in touch with Grocery\'s customer support team for any inquiries, order issues, or delivery concerns. We\'re here to help with your grocery shopping experience. Contact us today for prompt assistance.', 'login, sign in, grocery store account, customer login, grocery shopping login, secure login, online grocery store account, user login', 'Log in to your Grocery account to access your orders, track deliveries, manage your preferences, and enjoy a personalized shopping experience. Don’t have an account? Sign up now for faster checkout and more benefits.', 'sign up, create account, register, new account, grocery store registration, join grocery store, sign up for discounts, grocery shopping membership', 'Create an account at Grocery for a personalized shopping experience, faster checkouts, and exclusive deals. Sign up today and enjoy special offers on your next grocery shopping order!', 'forgot password, reset password, account recovery, password help, grocery store account recovery, password reset online, forgot my password', 'Forgot your password? Easily reset it by entering your email address. Follow the instructions to recover your account and continue shopping for groceries at Grocery without any hassle.', 'grocery shopping tips, healthy eating, food recipes, grocery store news, grocery offers, organic food blog, fresh produce, home cooking, meal planning, grocery hacks, grocery trends, food and nutrition, grocery guides', 'Stay up to date with the latest grocery shopping tips, healthy eating guides, delicious recipes, and exclusive offers on Grocery\'s blog. Discover the best ways to shop, cook, and live well with our expert advice and updates.', 'about grocery store, about us, our story, grocery store mission, online grocery store, fresh food store, grocery delivery service, organic grocery store, customer satisfaction, high-quality groceries, fresh food eCommerce', 'Learn more about Grocery – an online grocery store dedicated to providing fresh, high-quality groceries delivered right to your door. Discover our mission to offer convenient shopping and exceptional service to all our customers.', NULL, NULL),
(19, 11, 17, 'furniture store, online furniture shopping, buy furniture online, stylish furniture, quality furniture, living room furniture, bedroom furniture, home decor, furniture delivery, Furial furniture', 'Welcome to Furial – your online destination for high-quality, stylish furniture. Shop for living room sets, bedroom furniture, office pieces, and home décor with fast, reliable delivery. Transform your home with our curated collection of elegant and functional designs.', 'buy furniture online, online furniture store, living room furniture, bedroom furniture, home furniture, stylish sofas, modern furniture, home decor, furniture sale, furniture collection', 'Browse and shop premium furniture at Furial. From cozy sofas to elegant dining tables and bedroom furniture, find the perfect pieces to suit your style and space. Enjoy easy online shopping and fast delivery right to your door.', 'frequently asked questions, furniture FAQs, online shopping help, furniture delivery, order tracking, return policy, payment methods, customer support, furniture order questions', 'Got questions? Find answers to frequently asked questions about furniture, delivery, returns, payment methods, and more. Visit Furial’s FAQ page for all the information you need to make your shopping experience smooth and easy.', 'contact Furial, customer support, furniture help, contact customer service, online furniture store inquiries, support for furniture orders, reach Furial, get in touch with Furial', 'Need assistance? Contact Furial customer support for any inquiries, order issues, or delivery concerns. We\'re here to help with all your furniture shopping needs. Reach us via email or phone for quick support.', 'login to Furial, Furial account login, customer login, furniture shopping account, online store login, sign in Furial, secure login', 'Log in to your Furial account to track orders, manage your preferences, and shop faster. Enjoy a personalized shopping experience every time you visit our site. Don\'t have an account? Sign up now!', 'create Furial account, sign up for Furial, furniture store account, register for discounts, join Furial, online store registration, sign up for fast checkout', 'Sign up for a Furial account today to enjoy fast checkouts, exclusive offers, and personalized recommendations. Join our community and start shopping for beautiful furniture with ease.', 'reset password, forgot password, recover account, Furial password help, reset Furial login, password recovery, recover Furial account', 'Forgot your password? Easily reset it here and regain access to your Furial account. Enter your email, follow the instructions, and start shopping for your favorite furniture pieces again in no time!', 'furniture buying guide, interior design tips, furniture care, home décor ideas, furniture trends, modern furniture, home design, furniture tips, home styling, room makeovers', 'Stay inspired with expert interior design tips, the latest furniture trends, and helpful furniture care guides on Furial’s blog. Discover new ways to style your home and get tips for transforming your living space into something special.', 'about Furial, Furial furniture, furniture company, online furniture shop, quality furniture, home decor, Furial story, Furial mission, furniture business', 'Learn more about Furial, your trusted online furniture store offering high-quality, stylish pieces for every room. Discover our mission to bring you furniture that blends elegance, comfort, and functionality, all while providing excellent customer service.', NULL, NULL),
